  "dct_description_sm": [
    "We have assessed primary and secondary roads for road blockages in the La Guaira, Districto Capital, Yaracuy and Carabobo regions. The first instalment of data analysed is was taken on 29th June 2026. The data is held in a shapefile format using the WGS 84 EPSG: 4326 projection. You can find the Planetary Response Network Mozambique Flooding 2026 project we ran [here](https://www.zooniverse.org/projects/alicemead/planetary-response-network-venezuela-earthquake-2026)."
